OL,3,GNEWSA'Lime bike jousting is a form of
OL,4,Aperformance art'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe organisers of two Lime bike
OL,7,Fjousting events in east London have
OL,8,Fsaid they wanted to bring people
OL,9,Ftogether in a free experience to help
OL,10,Fthem "feel alive".
OL,12,FOn Saturday, actor Cameron
OL,13,FCarnegie-Brown, who jousts as
OL,14,FCamtholomew the First, and artist Jack
OL,15,FCarden met in London Fields Park,
OL,16,FHackney for a second duel on the hire
OL,17,Fe-bikes, with the match raising funds
OL,18,Ffor five charities.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
