OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Lime bike jousting is a form of
OL,4,Aperformance art'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, a professional jouster from
OL,7,FLeeds said that jousting on the Lime
OL,8,Fbikes was "absolutely a legitimate
OL,9,Fform" of the medieval sport.
OL,11,FLime previously said its bikes were
OL,12,F"not for jousting", and added: "While
OL,13,Fwe appreciate the medieval spirit,
OL,14,Fsafety must always come first".
